        "data": {
          "text": "A vibrant, sunny video scene: a young man and woman sitting on a green bench on a tennis court, taking a selfie with a white smartphone. The camera starts at a low angle and slowly tilts upward, revealing the clear blue sky. The man wears a light green jacket and shorts, the woman wears a light green blazer and trousers with a red and white striped turtleneck. The woman raises one arm playfully, and they hold hands, radiating youthful energy. The overall style is bright, cinematic, with smooth, slow camera movement and warm, vivid color grading."
